Office Open XML schemas

tools/ooxml-validate/schemas contains the ISO/IEC 29500-4:2016 (ECMA-376
Part 4, Transitional) XML Schema files for PresentationML and DrawingML, as
distributed in the python-docx repository (ref/xsd), with one marked local
amendment (see tools/ooxml-validate/README.md). They are used only by tests
and development tooling and are not shipped in the application.

Search models (downloaded on first use, not bundled)

Semantic search downloads one embedding model from Hugging Face, pinned to a
fixed revision and verified by SHA-256 (apps/shell/src/main/document-memory/
embedding-profiles.ts and embedding/model-specs.ts). The model weights are not
part of this repository or of the installer.

- Bekko-Embedding-v1 a8m and a25m, hotchpotch/bekko-embedding-v1-a8m and
  -a25m. Copyright the model authors. MIT License.
- EmbeddingGemma-2 (270M text tower), google/embeddinggemma-2, used through the
  community ONNX int8 export onnx-community/embeddinggemma-2-ONNX. Copyright
  Google LLC / Google DeepMind. The model card states the Apache License 2.0;
  use of the weights is also subject to the Gemma Prohibited Use Policy
  (https://ai.google.dev/gemma/prohibited_use_policy), which GenOffice users
  must follow when they choose the Mid or Plus search model. To drop that
  dependency, change MID_MODEL in embedding-profiles.ts to HARRIER_270M.
- Harrier-OSS-v1 270M, microsoft/harrier-oss-v1-270m, community ONNX export
  onnx-community/harrier-oss-v1-270m-ONNX. Copyright Microsoft. MIT License.
  Optional MIT-licensed substitute for EmbeddingGemma-2; not used by default.
- F2LLM-v2-80M (CodeFuse AI, Apache License 2.0) and Qwen3-Embedding-0.6B
  (Alibaba Cloud, Apache License 2.0): the original Standard and High search
  models, kept for existing installations.
